WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:05.040
If you want to see me pretty much just
be miserable,

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.670
then stick around to the

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:07.800
end of this video...

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:16.460
Look there might be a
couple that you can find,

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:18.640
But after

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.200
sitting through that thing for over two
hours

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.779
and it basically just being them

00:00:22.779 --> 00:00:27.609
filming the book but it takes place in
2002 instead of 1979, I really don't feel

00:00:27.609 --> 00:00:33.060
like it. Like... what do you want from me? I
had to sit through the area code line.

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:39.760
"This is so far from over it's not even in the same area code as over!"

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:44.469
You want me to tell you that the Freddie
Prince Jr. movie that Tommy references

00:00:44.469 --> 00:00:45.480
is She's All That,

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.010
a movie that I only know
about because of the rumor that M Night

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:49.540
Shyamalan ghost wrote it?

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.340
Or you
want me to tell you how they referenced

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.820
The Shining with that 'little pig, little
pig' line for no other reason than the

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.640
fact that it's a Stephen King movie that
people like?

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.900
"Little pigs, little pigs, let me in."

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.200
"Not by the hair on your chinny chin chin?"

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:05.600
Well too bad.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.460
I don't have the will to do this right now.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:09.320
I'll see you in the next one.

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.040
Assuming we both survive.

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:33.500
"SHUT UP!!!!!!!!!!"

